WEBVTT

00:10.719 --> 00:13.305
WARNING

00:15.891 --> 00:18.769
WARNING

00:20.979 --> 00:21.813
What is it?

00:22.231 --> 00:24.816
Border Intensity reading
is at plus 1.02!

00:25.025 --> 00:26.526
Why did it fluctuate so suddenly?!

00:26.652 --> 00:27.568
How should I know?

00:27.569 --> 00:29.696
It has to mean that something
is forcibly expanding

00:29.780 --> 00:31.198
the border's surface.

00:31.323 --> 00:33.742
W-What's happening?!

00:35.077 --> 00:36.495
The most likely possibility is...

00:38.205 --> 00:41.291
Captain Ukitake's power
is weakening.

00:47.256 --> 00:49.049
Akon, if this continues...

00:49.174 --> 00:50.092
I know!

00:58.934 --> 01:01.436
The three worlds
will cease to exist.

01:05.190 --> 01:09.069
THE CALAMITY

01:10.904 --> 01:13.407
<i>I've lived my way full of shame</i>

01:13.490 --> 01:17.828
<i>"Envy" comes from the ways
of the eventual end</i>

01:17.869 --> 01:20.330
<i>The ambiguous balance</i>

01:20.414 --> 01:23.250
<i>I want to cut ties at once</i>

01:24.543 --> 01:26.085
<i>It's too late to back down now</i>

01:26.086 --> 01:27.336
<i>Before this senile body dies</i>

01:27.337 --> 01:29.047
<i>My shadow will fade away soon, but</i>

01:29.089 --> 01:31.258
<i>Even if I disappear, my journey won't stop</i>

01:31.300 --> 01:32.800
<i>Uncertain days, certain endings</i>

01:32.801 --> 01:34.468
<i>My stories fill the in-betweens</i>

01:34.469 --> 01:37.221
<i>Beyond the wall blocking my way,
there is a calm morning</i>

01:37.222 --> 01:41.518
<i>Like the rising sun,
I stand with the wind at my back</i>

01:41.643 --> 01:45.688
<i>A burst of hope?</i>

01:45.689 --> 01:47.941
<i>Break through an endless night</i>

01:47.983 --> 01:52.904
<i>Show the sun waiting
at the end of darkness</i>

01:52.988 --> 01:56.032
<i>The promise is yet to be fulfilled</i>

01:56.033 --> 01:59.578
<i>but I stand in solitude not to let it go</i>

01:59.619 --> 02:02.496
<i>At the moment,
I'm connecting numerous lights</i>

02:02.497 --> 02:06.209
<i>to form a constellation
that paves tomorrow</i>

02:06.877 --> 02:10.714
<i>Even if the rain clouds
hide the night sky away</i>

02:10.756 --> 02:14.217
<i>there certainly is a flame in my heart</i>

02:14.551 --> 02:19.389
<i>God is no longer reliable</i>

02:19.556 --> 02:24.269
<i>I glance up towards the silver lining</i>

02:24.394 --> 02:30.566
<i>The destiny of bursting fate</i>

02:30.567 --> 02:32.944
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

02:46.792 --> 02:49.461
Do you wish that badly for despair?

02:50.003 --> 02:52.756
What's this?
What's happening?

02:53.340 --> 02:54.925
What's puzzling you?

02:55.050 --> 02:56.885
My power is The Miracle.

02:57.052 --> 03:00.472
The Miracle turns
the people's wishes into reality.

03:00.972 --> 03:03.684
I am Gerard Valkyrie!

03:04.142 --> 03:08.105
I am a miracle and
miracles are what I am!

03:14.778 --> 03:17.280
I don't know what the hell
he's talking about,

03:17.698 --> 03:19.991
but I do know that
he's got an ability

03:20.033 --> 03:21.576
that goes against all reason.

03:22.077 --> 03:23.203
Is that right?

03:23.745 --> 03:25.413
Well then,
all I gotta do is kill you

03:25.414 --> 03:27.124
without breaking the sword, right?

03:27.541 --> 03:30.961
You're a naïve bastard,
giving me the solution yourself!

03:31.336 --> 03:32.712
You're gonna regret that!

03:33.213 --> 03:36.925
I'm telling you in order to fill
the enormous gap in our powers.

03:37.134 --> 03:39.845
You're a naïve bastard,
if you didn't realize that!

03:39.886 --> 03:41.263
You will regret that!

03:41.596 --> 03:45.308
I'm getting the feeling these two
are alike...

03:55.902 --> 03:57.362
You dodged!
How about that...

03:57.696 --> 03:59.865
You're faster than you look!

04:00.407 --> 04:01.491
You're not so bad yourself.

04:01.575 --> 04:04.744
I was going to crush you
in my hand...

04:05.245 --> 04:06.830
You're nimble!

04:07.247 --> 04:08.498
Guncho Tsurara!

04:08.915 --> 04:09.833
You pest!

04:10.125 --> 04:12.377
You are not my opponent!

04:15.297 --> 04:16.840
What the hell are you doing,
Zaraki?!

04:17.132 --> 04:18.425
That's my line!

04:18.675 --> 04:19.885
Stay out of this!

04:20.260 --> 04:22.763
Get your asses out of here!

04:23.096 --> 04:24.139
You bastard...

04:24.473 --> 04:25.307
Let it go.

04:25.557 --> 04:26.641
You're wasting your breath.

04:26.808 --> 04:30.562
Zaraki can't be
reasoned with either.

04:31.104 --> 04:32.063
I know.

04:32.731 --> 04:35.525
But we can't go on ahead
without Zaraki.

04:36.568 --> 04:38.945
This guy's not an opponent
Zaraki can beat by himself.

04:39.946 --> 04:41.114
If you want proof, look...

04:41.948 --> 04:45.494
Zaraki's already taken
his eye patch off!

04:46.328 --> 04:48.747
He instinctively knows...

04:49.372 --> 04:52.542
this isn't someone he can beat
with his eye patch on.

04:54.294 --> 04:57.172
<i>Many of the Ice Flowers
have fallen already.</i>

04:58.089 --> 04:58.924
<i>It's understandable.</i>

04:59.549 --> 05:01.092
<i>We're all exhausted.</i>

05:02.093 --> 05:04.513
<i>I guess we're all running out of time...</i>

05:05.013 --> 05:05.847
Kuchiki.

05:06.765 --> 05:10.268
I'll find an opportunity and
freeze that giant.

05:10.936 --> 05:13.104
Use your Senbonzakura
to pulverize him.

05:13.897 --> 05:15.148
Given what I've gathered,

05:15.649 --> 05:18.318
I should be able to freeze him
to the bone at maximum output.

05:19.361 --> 05:20.737
But it's going to take some time.

05:21.446 --> 05:22.322
So I need your help.

05:23.281 --> 05:24.157
Understood.

05:28.995 --> 05:30.080
What's the matter?

05:30.330 --> 05:32.332
Your sword is losing its power.

05:33.166 --> 05:34.668
Well, of course it is!

05:35.126 --> 05:37.295
Fighting me
without chipping my sword

05:37.420 --> 05:38.880
was impossible to begin with!

05:39.422 --> 05:41.591
In a fight, swords chip,

05:41.842 --> 05:46.096
and "despair" will be carved
into your body!

05:47.097 --> 05:48.056
You are relentless!

05:48.306 --> 05:50.308
I applaud your spirit!

05:50.809 --> 05:54.104
But spirit cannot fill in the gap
between our powers!

05:57.899 --> 06:00.193
I see you, Byakuya Kuchiki!

06:01.027 --> 06:01.987
And...

06:02.237 --> 06:04.239
Toshiro Hitsugaya!

06:05.365 --> 06:09.160
You are planning
to catch me off guard...

06:09.452 --> 06:11.329
I see it all!

06:11.872 --> 06:15.625
I am the biggest, strongest,
and fastest Quincy!

06:16.042 --> 06:18.795
I am the warrior
that was bestowed everything!

06:19.337 --> 06:22.465
Don't think you can outwit me!

06:24.676 --> 06:26.052
<i>Whatcha doing?</i>

06:28.013 --> 06:28.847
<i>Hey...</i>

06:29.472 --> 06:31.725
<i>Whatcha doing, Kenny?</i>

06:34.769 --> 06:35.854
<i>Yachiru...</i>

06:36.521 --> 06:37.772
<i>C'mon, get up.</i>

06:38.189 --> 06:40.191
<i>Let's keep going, let's keep going!</i>

06:40.525 --> 06:41.443
<i>C'mon!</i>

06:42.944 --> 06:44.029
<i>Yachiru...</i>

06:44.738 --> 06:46.531
<i>Where have you been all this time?</i>

06:46.656 --> 06:47.616
<i>Kenny...</i>

06:48.325 --> 06:53.955
<i>If you use me properly,
there's nobody you can't cut!</i>

06:58.543 --> 06:59.544
<i>What was that?</i>

06:59.878 --> 07:01.713
<i>What did you just do?</i>

07:02.547 --> 07:03.423
<i>This power...</i>

07:04.299 --> 07:05.216
<i>See?</i>

07:05.383 --> 07:07.761
<i>You don't know anything, Kenny!</i>

07:08.845 --> 07:10.639
<i>The name of that power is...</i>

07:12.098 --> 07:13.642
<i>Bankai, okay?</i>

07:19.939 --> 07:20.857
What's happening?

07:21.149 --> 07:22.025
Is this Zaraki?!

07:24.277 --> 07:25.403
This Spiritual Pressure...

07:25.528 --> 07:27.197
No way,
was that Captain Zaraki's...?!

07:35.914 --> 07:36.790
Is that...?

07:36.998 --> 07:37.874
Look.

07:37.957 --> 07:39.292
Zaraki's skin has...

07:39.459 --> 07:40.293
...turned red.

07:41.378 --> 07:43.713
A sudden rise
in Spiritual Pressure...

07:44.130 --> 07:45.507
I thought it might be your Bankai,

07:45.632 --> 07:47.759
but I see no significant
change at all...

07:47.842 --> 07:49.636
What a total letdown.

07:50.595 --> 07:52.597
Surely you don't
expect me to believe

07:52.722 --> 07:54.349
that broken blade is your Bankai?

07:55.350 --> 07:58.269
You bore me, Kenpachi Zaraki.

07:58.520 --> 08:01.481
It would be a waste
to swing Hoffnung

08:01.606 --> 08:03.066
when your blade is broken.

08:03.483 --> 08:05.026
I shall smash you into oblivion!

08:19.791 --> 08:20.709
Foolishness!

08:21.042 --> 08:23.837
I've told you,
ripping off my arm is meaningless!

08:28.258 --> 08:29.134
Impossible!

08:29.551 --> 08:30.635
My shield!

08:35.974 --> 08:37.308
<i>Th-This can't be happening.</i>

08:37.475 --> 08:39.227
<i>What is this power?!</i>

08:42.731 --> 08:43.606
Damn it!

08:43.690 --> 08:44.649
He kicked him off!

08:47.944 --> 08:48.820
Impossible!

08:48.903 --> 08:50.989
Impossible, impossible, impossible!

08:51.531 --> 08:54.409
A Soul Reaper pushing me
to the brink?

08:55.535 --> 08:58.663
This absurdity cannot be happening!

09:00.457 --> 09:02.834
Not running away is
the pinnacle of stupidity!

09:02.959 --> 09:04.753
Turn to ash and perish!

09:16.765 --> 09:19.059
Did the Captain get him?!

09:19.267 --> 09:20.435
He's incredible...

09:23.897 --> 09:24.773
A miracle...

09:26.816 --> 09:27.776
Captain Hirako!

09:30.028 --> 09:31.112
Allow me to assist you now!

09:31.821 --> 09:32.739
Momo...

09:33.406 --> 09:34.324
Never mind me...

09:34.908 --> 09:36.409
See to them instead.

09:36.659 --> 09:37.494
Huh?

09:37.744 --> 09:38.703
Kuchiki!

09:38.912 --> 09:39.746
Abarai!

09:40.747 --> 09:43.208
All right then,
I'm counting on you, okay?

09:54.344 --> 09:55.178
Zara...

09:56.221 --> 09:59.307
So... you don't think
we should go near him?

10:00.141 --> 10:01.267
That look on his face...

10:01.768 --> 10:03.394
is proof it will be more difficult

10:03.478 --> 10:04.938
to get through to him than usual...

10:08.650 --> 10:09.484
What?!

10:20.203 --> 10:21.037
Huh?!

10:23.706 --> 10:24.749
What's going on?!

10:28.878 --> 10:29.921
No way!

10:30.171 --> 10:31.506
That monster...

10:53.778 --> 10:54.654
Damn it!

10:56.489 --> 10:58.158
Kuchiki! Abarai!

11:04.497 --> 11:07.375
Somehow, I managed to keep it
from falling.

11:15.466 --> 11:20.013
I am Ashtonig,
The Noble Warrior of God.

11:22.974 --> 11:27.353
The one who swings his sword
for God, even in death!

11:37.197 --> 11:38.573
<i>Sorry about that, Kenny.</i>

11:38.698 --> 11:41.367
<i>I released too much of your power.</i>

11:41.784 --> 11:45.121
<i>Looks like your body
couldn't handle it.</i>

11:51.753 --> 11:53.338
Z-Zaraki...

11:54.589 --> 11:56.132
Are you still breathing?

12:02.597 --> 12:04.015
K-Kuchiki...

12:05.516 --> 12:08.061
Undo your Bankai,
Captain Hitsugaya.

12:11.231 --> 12:12.649
You are at your limit...

12:13.483 --> 12:15.568
No... not yet.

12:16.277 --> 12:17.695
Captain Hitsugaya...

12:20.865 --> 12:23.993
I don't ever recall
saying that it's over...

12:24.911 --> 12:26.496
when all the Ice Flowers fall.

12:27.789 --> 12:29.791
When the last Ice Flower
has fallen...

12:31.542 --> 12:32.543
That's when...

12:33.920 --> 12:36.839
...Daiguren Hyorinmaru is finally
complete.

12:52.105 --> 12:57.402
My power isn't developed enough yet
to have full command of Hyorinmaru.

12:58.444 --> 13:00.113
I don't know if that's why, but...

13:00.655 --> 13:04.826
when Daiguren Hyorinmaru's
complete,

13:07.120 --> 13:08.871
I become a little bit older.

13:09.831 --> 13:13.001
I don't really like this form
all that much, though.

13:14.627 --> 13:16.504
Who the hell are you?

13:17.422 --> 13:19.132
Toshiro Hitsugaya.

13:19.799 --> 13:20.967
Is that your Bankai?

13:21.217 --> 13:24.554
No... I thought you already released
your Bankai.

13:25.054 --> 13:27.056
How did you change your form
even more?

13:27.640 --> 13:29.726
Well, it doesn't matter!

13:32.437 --> 13:34.522
Your present form makes you

13:34.647 --> 13:38.109
a more worthy opponent
than you were earlier!

13:38.651 --> 13:39.694
Oh, is that right?

13:39.944 --> 13:41.779
You've transformed and
yet you still run away?!

13:52.540 --> 13:54.876
Don't throw that gigantic thing.

13:55.126 --> 13:56.085
I told you already—

13:56.210 --> 13:58.087
It will be bad news if it falls
on Seireitei.

14:00.631 --> 14:01.507
You fool!

14:01.632 --> 14:02.800
Have you forgotten?!

14:02.925 --> 14:04.218
When Hoffnung is damaged...

14:04.343 --> 14:08.473
If it's frozen,
all matter ceases to function.

14:15.146 --> 14:18.191
All of your "hope"
has stopped functioning.

14:19.025 --> 14:20.234
I see.

14:20.693 --> 14:21.569
Well then...

14:23.112 --> 14:25.990
I will crush you
with a torrent of power...

14:26.616 --> 14:29.619
without any supernatural functions!

14:30.036 --> 14:31.621
A Quincy Bow?

14:32.789 --> 14:35.374
That decision
comes a bit too late.

14:36.501 --> 14:37.919
Shikai Hyoketsu.

14:38.836 --> 14:40.963
It freezes all earth,
water, fire and wind...

14:41.255 --> 14:43.674
in the space you've occupied
within four steps

14:43.758 --> 14:46.552
after releasing
Daiguren Hyorinmaru.

14:47.386 --> 14:50.431
If you had shot the Quincy Arrow
within three steps or less,

14:50.807 --> 14:53.142
you might have been able to hit me.

14:58.564 --> 14:59.524
I will not freeze.

14:59.774 --> 15:01.943
I am God's Warrior!

15:02.527 --> 15:05.655
I cannot be bound by the elements
of this world!

15:06.781 --> 15:09.575
I will crush you, damn it!

15:11.577 --> 15:13.037
What?!

15:16.707 --> 15:17.917
Zaraki!

15:18.042 --> 15:20.253
You bastard,
what did you do to my leg?!

15:23.798 --> 15:26.050
Do you think
you'll come away from this unscathed,

15:26.134 --> 15:27.885
touching me in this state?

15:28.344 --> 15:31.556
I told you I cannot be frozen,
Soul Reaper!

15:36.936 --> 15:39.856
Senkei Senbonzakura Kageyoshi.

15:43.568 --> 15:44.402
Ultimate technique...

15:45.194 --> 15:46.696
Ikka Senjinka!

16:08.134 --> 16:09.051
Kuchiki...

16:09.802 --> 16:13.055
It seems your Bankai takes
a heavy toll on your body...

16:13.598 --> 16:15.474
but you're holding up
better than I expected.

16:16.767 --> 16:18.227
Good observation.

16:18.686 --> 16:20.354
I'm almost at my limit.

16:22.148 --> 16:23.065
What is that?!

16:26.986 --> 16:29.280
He's still alive?!

16:36.329 --> 16:38.080
W-what is that?!

16:41.167 --> 16:43.544
Kuchiki! Abarai!
You're alive!!

16:44.253 --> 16:47.215
This is what became of the enemy
you all were fighting!

16:47.673 --> 16:49.467
He's a monster!
Be careful!

16:50.259 --> 16:51.135
Uh...

16:51.469 --> 16:52.345
Who's that?!

16:52.428 --> 16:54.597
Fool!
Can't you tell by his voice?!

16:55.223 --> 16:57.475
It's most likely
Captain Hitsugaya's older brother!

16:57.642 --> 16:58.517
Oh!

16:58.684 --> 16:59.644
Nice to meet you!

16:59.727 --> 17:01.771
Yes, that's right.
Nice to meet you too.

17:02.230 --> 17:03.105
You're playing along?

17:05.358 --> 17:06.817
Go around that way, Renji!

17:06.943 --> 17:07.777
Got it!

17:09.612 --> 17:10.446
Ouch!

17:12.365 --> 17:13.783
Renji. Rukia...

17:14.575 --> 17:17.245
You two,
go to where Ichigo Kurosaki is.

17:17.662 --> 17:19.205
- Huh?
- But Elder Brother...

17:19.455 --> 17:20.706
Look at the Spiritual Pressure.

17:21.415 --> 17:26.212
As you both must have noticed,
he's already confronting Yhwach.

17:28.422 --> 17:29.757
But...

17:29.924 --> 17:30.967
Why do you hesitate?

17:31.759 --> 17:32.802
Don't flatter yourselves.

17:35.763 --> 17:39.517
I'm not saying that Kurosaki needs
your help.

17:40.393 --> 17:44.605
I'm saying your help
is not needed here.

17:46.357 --> 17:47.733
If you understand, go.

17:48.484 --> 17:50.403
- Yes, Sir! Thank you!
- Yes, Sir! Thank you!

17:54.073 --> 17:55.116
Welcome back.

17:55.825 --> 17:59.036
They saw right through
your kind concern.

17:59.662 --> 18:02.582
I meant for them to see through it
from the start.

18:03.499 --> 18:04.542
In any event...

18:05.501 --> 18:07.086
I think it was the right decision.

18:07.920 --> 18:10.590
They should be with Kurosaki.

18:11.799 --> 18:15.052
I don't know if you attended
the Academy or not, but...

18:15.720 --> 18:21.183
I wasn't taught to fight for
my superiors and family.

18:22.435 --> 18:24.812
"All Soul Reapers ought to,
without exception,"

18:25.104 --> 18:27.732
"die protecting friends
and humanity."

18:30.776 --> 18:33.029
Kurosaki's our comrade,

18:33.904 --> 18:34.905
but to them,

18:35.489 --> 18:37.408
he's a friend.

18:38.284 --> 18:40.494
If they are to fight
as Soul Reapers,

18:40.578 --> 18:43.664
it's only right that
they join Kurosaki.

18:44.749 --> 18:46.626
The scales of life and death,
is it?

18:47.209 --> 18:49.128
Such a Soul Reaper teaching.

18:49.962 --> 18:51.797
Even if the situation
were reversed,

18:51.881 --> 18:55.051
they would have still gone to him.

19:00.014 --> 19:01.181
<i>Retracing memories</i>

19:01.182 --> 19:04.935
<i>An unexpected gaze</i>

19:05.019 --> 19:07.480
<i>The world I didn't want</i>

19:07.521 --> 19:09.607
<i>I've started breaking it down</i>

19:09.649 --> 19:12.108
<i>Lean on each other and face forward</i>

19:12.109 --> 19:14.779
<i>I want to change my fate</i>

19:14.862 --> 19:18.115
<i>All the voices shout</i>

19:18.157 --> 19:20.159
<i>The sound rang out</i>

19:35.591 --> 19:38.134
<i>I saw countless scattered shadows</i>

19:38.135 --> 19:40.471
<i>and I laughed</i>

19:40.638 --> 19:42.890
<i>A world that's lost its color</i>

19:42.932 --> 19:45.226
<i>I'll illuminate it again</i>

19:45.309 --> 19:47.895
<i>Broken and lamenting</i>

19:47.978 --> 19:50.523
<i>The end of the dream</i>

19:50.606 --> 19:55.027
<i>Shaking free from it over and over again
with a still-connected heart</i>

19:55.069 --> 20:00.573
<i>I'll protect today,
the path I've walked all this time</i>

20:00.574 --> 20:01.826
<i>Break it</i>

20:01.992 --> 20:04.412
<i>Tear the future apart, call my name</i>

20:04.453 --> 20:07.455
<i>Turn your back on your predetermined past</i>

20:07.456 --> 20:10.000
<i>Today keeps playing with fate</i>

20:10.042 --> 20:12.294
<i>Reclaim it here and now</i>

20:12.378 --> 20:14.839
<i>To the ends of the earth, an unseen dream</i>

20:14.922 --> 20:17.591
<i>With eyes that know the strength
that lies in words</i>

20:17.675 --> 20:20.720
<i>Notice the distorted spiral</i>

20:20.803 --> 20:24.305
<i>My fate has been set in motion</i>

20:24.306 --> 20:28.436
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

20:28.519 --> 20:31.063
WARNING

20:29.645 --> 20:32.690
The circulation of souls
is unstable!

20:32.898 --> 20:36.068
WARNING

20:34.233 --> 20:35.526
If this continues...

20:42.491 --> 20:44.660
Hollows will overflow into
the World of the Living.

20:45.119 --> 20:47.621
We have our hands full over here
with a bird monster!

20:48.080 --> 20:50.249
We can't spare anyone to go
to the World of the Living!

20:51.959 --> 20:52.793
I...

20:53.669 --> 20:54.670
I will go!

20:55.838 --> 20:58.549
We were originally in charge
of Karakura Town.

20:59.633 --> 21:01.510
Protecting the people there...

21:02.887 --> 21:04.138
is our job!

21:05.681 --> 21:07.933
I don't know how much
we can do, but...

21:09.059 --> 21:11.020
we'll do the best we can.

21:11.103 --> 21:12.021
Ouch!

21:12.146 --> 21:14.273
Don't slap me like that, Shino!

21:14.398 --> 21:17.443
Get a grip! If you say
you're going to do it yourself,

21:17.610 --> 21:19.987
say it like you mean it to
the very end, Ryunosuke!

21:22.907 --> 21:24.200
You're not alone.

21:24.784 --> 21:26.702
Even if your spirit wavers
100 times,

21:26.994 --> 21:29.580
I'll slap your back 101 times
to encourage you.

21:31.749 --> 21:32.666
Shino...

21:33.918 --> 21:35.084
That's one too many, though––

21:35.085 --> 21:36.587
Oh, shut up!

21:43.093 --> 21:44.428
Lieutenant Okikiba!

21:51.352 --> 21:52.269
We'll protect them...

21:52.686 --> 21:53.562
Together!

21:53.896 --> 21:54.730
Yes!

21:59.235 --> 22:00.152
I see...

22:00.653 --> 22:02.822
So that's what
you were trying to do.

22:22.716 --> 22:24.718
K-Kurosaki...

22:25.261 --> 22:26.095
Hey.

22:35.771 --> 22:37.064
I'm okay, Inoue.

22:37.565 --> 22:38.440
I'm still me.

22:41.610 --> 22:43.988
You look like a Hollow.

22:44.321 --> 22:48.450
Is that the Hollow melded together
with your power?

22:49.368 --> 22:50.202
That's right.

22:51.495 --> 22:52.496
Truth is...

22:52.705 --> 22:54.498
He's melded together
with my power,

22:54.999 --> 22:58.002
so I should be able to
call him out at will.

22:58.752 --> 23:01.171
But I'm still not
good at it at all, so...

23:01.672 --> 23:04.508
I used your power to help me.

23:07.928 --> 23:10.764
<i>Kurosaki, when did you get
in front of Rikka?</i>

23:11.432 --> 23:13.809
Stay back, Inoue.

23:14.435 --> 23:15.769
I'm going to make some more room.

23:16.729 --> 23:17.563
Okay!

23:24.111 --> 23:25.988
Such a magnificent power.

23:26.989 --> 23:27.948
All right then.

23:28.532 --> 23:31.285
I will draw my sword
and take you on.

23:38.542 --> 23:39.376
How weak.

23:40.127 --> 23:42.755
Did you think you could
kill me with this?

23:45.257 --> 23:46.717
Getsugatensho, eh?

23:47.343 --> 23:49.428
It's the same thing!

23:52.431 --> 23:55.309
<i>No! This isn't Getsugatensho.</i>

23:56.060 --> 23:57.853
<i>It's Getsugatensho mixed with...</i>

23:58.479 --> 23:59.855
<i>a Gran Rey Cero!</i>

24:07.488 --> 24:12.201
<i>There's nothing I can do.
I just want power...</i>

24:13.869 --> 24:17.122
<i>The power to protect.
That is all I want...</i>
